==Battleground==
*30 [[Snache]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*30 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

